1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:05,541
Here's BobHead. Give it a talking clip, and it makes a big-head version

2
00:00:05,541 --> 00:00:07,139
with the same dialogue.

3
00:00:08,142 --> 00:00:12,254
Unzip the download, then open the BobHead folder.

4
00:00:12,254 --> 00:00:14,310
Keep everything here together.

5
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:19,172
The app, ComfyUI, custom nodes, and workflow are included.

6
00:00:19,172 --> 00:00:22,569
The readme is there if you need help.

7
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:28,125
Double-click Launch BobHead. That's the only file you need to open.

8
00:00:28,125 --> 00:00:31,828
It starts the engine and brings up the app.

9
00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:35,830
The first time, click Download required models.

10
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:41,365
It's about a hundred and two gigabytes, so leave plenty of space and

11
00:00:41,365 --> 00:00:43,068
keep your internet on.

12
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:47,057
You can pause and pick up later.

13
00:00:47,057 --> 00:00:50,859
Once all twelve models say Installed, close this window.

14
00:00:50,859 --> 00:00:53,393
You only do this setup once.

15
00:00:54,433 --> 00:00:58,756
Drop in your talking clip, or click here to choose one.

16
00:00:58,756 --> 00:01:02,686
This time, we're using the clip with the original sound.

17
00:01:08,725 --> 00:01:13,227
Choose how many seconds to use. Five is a good start.

18
00:01:13,227 --> 00:01:18,138
The head effect is already set, so there's nothing else to adjust.

19
00:01:19,142 --> 00:01:24,066
Now click Make me a bobhead. The first frame guides the look, and

20
00:01:24,066 --> 00:01:25,960
the video guides the movement.

21
00:01:26,975 --> 00:01:32,169
Let it finish. This can take a few minutes, so I've skipped the

22
00:01:32,169 --> 00:01:32,569
wait.

23
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:36,516
Here's the result, with the original dialogue.

24
00:01:36,516 --> 00:01:41,098
Play it back, then use the download button to save it.

25
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:50,962
To make another, click Replace and choose your next clip.

26
00:01:50,962 --> 00:01:53,279
That's all there is to it.
